{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Revenants</strong> is a turn-based strategy game with RPG elements inspired by ATOM RPG and XCOM.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re one of the survivors of the nuclear war. Try to survive in a post-apocalyptic world. Find companions, upgrade your skills and fight for staying alive. Your life depends on your decisions and tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/choose-weapon-eng.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find different weapons in the world, from a machine gun to a water pipe. Choose what you like. Aim and shoot at enemies with a gun or stab them with a handmade spear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/wpwpwp.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/exploration__1_.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search residential buildings, shops, pharmacies and cars in automatic or manual mode. Collect weapons, equipment, supplies \u2014 anything that can help you live longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/\u043e\u0431\u044b\u0441\u043a3.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/inventory__1_.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't take everything you find with you, so take only what you need. Place things in your inventory. You can also craft different items. Try to combine collected materials and see what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/\u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0440\u044c_.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/survival-eng.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your hunger, thirst, and energy levels. Illnesses, injuries, and radiation will affect the characters' health. Use medicine to get rid of the negative effects. Along the way, you will also get into unexpected situations, and even the life of your comrade may depend on your actions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/\u0435\u0434\u0430.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/Group_1895.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/logotype.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286430?t=1750234547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286430?t=1750234547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/0b5170ebd343f05ba78844379fb91b75c7727125/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750234547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/0b5170ebd343f05ba78844379fb91b75c7727125/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750234547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3693790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Revenants</strong> is a turn-based strategy game with RPG elements inspired by ATOM RPG and XCOM.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re one of the survivors of the nuclear war. Try to survive in a post-apocalyptic world. Find companions, upgrade your skills and fight for staying alive. Your life depends on your decisions and tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/choose-weapon-eng.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can find different weapons in the world, from a machine gun to a water pipe. Choose what you like. Aim and shoot at enemies with a gun or stab them with a handmade spear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/wpwpwp.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/exploration__1_.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search residential buildings, shops, pharmacies and cars in automatic or manual mode. Collect weapons, equipment, supplies \u2014 anything that can help you live longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/\u043e\u0431\u044b\u0441\u043a3.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/inventory__1_.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't take everything you find with you, so take only what you need. Place things in your inventory. You can also craft different items. Try to combine collected materials and see what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/\u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0440\u044c_.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/survival-eng.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your hunger, thirst, and energy levels. Illnesses, injuries, and radiation will affect the characters' health. Use medicine to get rid of the negative effects. Along the way, you will also get into unexpected situations, and even the life of your comrade may depend on your actions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/\u0435\u0434\u0430.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/Group_1895.png?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/logotype.gif?t=1750234547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sliva Group"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/d464e3ca57bb0106a428ba5900d89c5cc1fe8448/header.jpg?t=1750234547","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies